  "body": "Nowaday some script file are quite large and can take up some times to be loaded. When the required script for the feature of the site not yet ready, we might want to show summary progress of everything that stalled the process, be it image or the 3rd party framework's script itself\r\n\r\nUltimately I wish everything `HTMLElement` that has loading and async functionality should also emit progress event\r\n\r\nAlso instead of percentage of progress, I wish it would be size in byte for loading and total\r\n\r\nIs this possible?",
